{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790534520, "covers_from": "2026-09-27T18:42:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-27T18:43:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790534580, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-27T18:42:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 30566, "sprite_key": "penguin_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "教育", "content": "營養午餐學生都免費了，為什麼要跟老師收錢。我是學生家長", "display_name": "中正代表 No.30,566", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-27T18:42:09+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 26182, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "市長，台北市有些路口的行人交通號誌秒數過短，是否可以改善？謝謝！", "display_name": "松山代表 No.26,182", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-27T18:42:20+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 50413, "sprite_key": "bear_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "其他", "content": "我希望未來的台北市長沈伯洋先生可以有休息的時間。也希望團隊能夠注意他的安全，謝謝", "display_name": "大安代表 No.50,413", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-27T18:42:32+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 52296, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "還是很多汽機車不禮讓斑馬線上的行人，請市長能夠在路口處，加設科技執法", "display_name": "松山代表 No.52,296", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-27T18:42:43+00:00", "duration_seconds": 17, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 49761, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "希望噗馬把一樓前面的馬路還給大家使用，不是公用道路變成私人專用！", "display_name": "松山代表 Ric", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 26182, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.26,182", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 50413, "sprite_key": "bear_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.50,413", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "fr